=== parameters ===
alpha=0.05 VaR; lookback L=252 for hist/param; MC paths=5000; Kupiec LR on exceptions
all risk estimates use only past returns (shift so day-t VaR uses data through t-1)
cite: Kupiec 1995 J. Derivatives — Techniques for verifying the accuracy of risk measurement models
cite: Artzner et al. 1999 Math. Finance — Coherent measures of risk (CVaR/ES motivation)
cite: lag all estimates — no look-ahead into same-day PnL

